<<<
+ defining. 4. And or but who(m). 5. Person & number of who(m). 6. Personification. 7. Who(m) & participle.
===
+ defining. 4. *And* or *but who(m)*. 5. Person & number of *who(m)*. 6. Personification. 7. *Who(m)* & participle.
